// Kioto 3.0.0 — package entry point.
//
// This file is deliberately not useful on its own. Its only job is to exercise
// the `load kioto::<module>` statements below against the [exports] table in
// owl.toml, so a broken export or an unresolvable path fails loudly here
// instead of in some consumer's build.
//
// The load statements are added in phases 2 and 3, as each module is moved
// into modules/ with the .mr extension. During the skeleton reset this file
// deliberately loads nothing.
